{"3748620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lizards VS Humans", "steam_appid": 3748620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the war-torn universe of <i>Lizards Vs Humans</i>, a fast-paced, class-based sci-fi multiplayer FPS where ancient alien warriors and elite space marines battle across the stars for supremacy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your side in an epic conflict spanning frozen moons, abandoned stations, blazing deserts, and futuristic cities built in craters and valleys. Will you stand with humanity, defending its last colonies in high-tech power armor? Or embrace the primal fury of the Lizard People, reptilian warriors wielding plasma-edged blades and biotech weaponry?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just war. This is extinction or evolution.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the war-torn universe of <i>Lizards Vs Humans</i>, a fast-paced, class-based sci-fi multiplayer FPS where ancient alien warriors and elite space marines battle across the stars for supremacy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your side in an epic conflict spanning frozen moons, abandoned stations, blazing deserts, and futuristic cities built in craters and valleys. Will you stand with humanity, defending its last colonies in high-tech power armor? Or embrace the primal fury of the Lizard People, reptilian warriors wielding plasma-edged blades and biotech weaponry?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just war. This is extinction or evolution.</p>", "short_description": "A multiplayer FPS Sci-Fi game set in an alternate reality where reptilian beings battle humans for control of Earth. Features unique species-specific abilities, diverse weapon systems, and tactical gameplay.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748620/56a378d9024373ce87e95913f18bc08366cb46bc/header.jpg?t=1767271679", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748620/c1397b50066624b77b973a01c4f9013929d56e45/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767271679", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748620/c1397b50066624b77b973a01c4f9013929d56e45/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767271679", "website": "https://bigais.github.io/project-allecc/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 (4 GB) or AMD Radeon RX 570 (4 GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Aims for 1080p/30fps on Low settings. SSD Recommended</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 7435HS or Intel Core i5-13400F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 (8 GB) or AMD Radeon RX 6600 XT (8 GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Aims for 1080p/60fps on High settings. SSD Required for best experience.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Ioannis Papadopoulos", "Vasilios Chiliaridis"], "publishers": ["Project Allecc", "Ioannis Papadopoulos"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 49, "description": "PvP"}, {"id": 36